Conformance-fixture and reference-verifier repository. Fixtures are deterministic and pinned by SHA-256 in MANIFEST.sha256; reference verifiers are validated by running them against the fixture set. The 8-phase /pre-push-review (new-user walkthrough, adversarial corpus, score sanity, concept-explainer, real-world dev-tree scan) does not apply. Quality gate for this repo is "both reference verifiers PASS every ACCEPT fixture and REJECT every REJECT fixture, MANIFEST.sha256 reproduces clean."
